  "description": "Summoned back to his family's estate on his twentieth birthday as the official heir, Patrick expects a warm homecoming. Instead, he finds an eerily quiet mansion—and a dark trap waiting for him. Awakened in the middle of the night by a mysterious kiss, Patrick opens his eyes to find Aebel Morton, a picture-perfect gentleman hiding dangerous motives. Before Patrick can even react, he is imprisoned within the mansion walls. Who is this flawless stranger, and why has he locked Patrick away in his own home?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
